[38;2;124;124;124m$C_G(s) = \{g \in G : gs = sg\}$ is the centralizer of $s$ in $G$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSince $T$ is a torus, $T$ is abelian. So all elements of $T$ commute with each [0m
